          high: -9078687390032257894
        editorPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
        speakerName: Grumble
        text: Three giant mushrooms, that's all I ask. They grow down in the caverns -- the mine tracks and around the water.
        nextNodeId:
          low: 6114180659835385954
          high: -8637442658214050479
    - rid: 2954408717933871109
      type: {class: LineNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId:
          low: -6834942902365421045
          high: -7150200445702264185
        editorPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
        speakerName: Grumble
        text: Now THAT is a mushroom! Here, take this for your trouble -- and a little something to patch yourselves up.
        nextNodeId:
          low: 5021339053335833588
          high: -8951316234318967686
